/p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ynWPy1lRVY5AYDpOP9yBicN1CfAf6OmD45yCA14S2Gks1gMfBen4kjGndjs7KqmEBOhBjnko9BPwWFB2MzcpsZ6o83AS49P8HacE931wgSEk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ynWPy1lRVY7icDse3aebcs6G5OichdqqSe5JqBOzgRybS22XFS01VDAaJrDB7l2ZYicwt9ic0yoxEFT751aEAD8mzIibC8MTuRwJCUSze49cicOXU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>社团活动</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>向下滑动查看所有学生活动照片</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY7a8icbDJjeict7QQINRUE4QJSelczEE3mpl81bkpzian2Qfq725vRyZxDJ5xa3gPYNszqodS4gQmyk3M27fAYE18jbX6rqf2YI5w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY7L6PVQ1SdOLicYXZUYXTDeZrqAYl1jESua9C1SeokMicLVByia7AaykYF6DXaP7SlUCQxUhbUAKiccrqS3dD6bw3HSX2jm7PItVyo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY4ibLFDuBhqD425riah8sNkicOVsicNuY2mTl0eLYsz3v5YrsibyXfAGIVL9mpM6LLPK0fflyZ9zbtse8MHKEhz2q2GgNxYpEbMma6Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY61aq0UqI8VPnKjOVK1GYGyCcMRdMV7LruZm0ojIAkhSDTpHaG8NicZAteia03kribXbhdJj33rmlWzrTMzM9uIZ9pSqTFXdf6JibU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营活动</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY7x9wT7N57JlDF5nBW0bAN58wH9m5jjmzfysLztBjiaibmnoh8EFIXDP70xZCibPjzqib08XDzfxmyWbOOict1y7GDha9tL4sYxmiaSw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY5JyfQNibng5valC2OavvZhAdxoEAxucyxdUpSEib5licuXzpFxcibPaDPAmRuy8WrLGZicicfsTT0GuGhtAVKFFaQCNM5jQbGAZd6icM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间：</span></strong><span>即日起至2026年7月6日。</span></p><p><strong><span>招收人数：</span></strong><span>视报名情况而定。</span></p><p><strong><span>活动时间：</span></strong><span>2026年7月下旬。</span></p><p><strong><span>活动形式：</span></strong><span>线下线上结合，具体时间和活动内容另行通知。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY7IC3oauJ2KdHDtBGzxNZwP1mC6zCxjibH0N3iathuyWShDticucxosOleDY3vVLcFHTBRVlWsibmFWbdodV5XWricwYA4mvL53YtuY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>（1）具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></p><p><span>（2）对科学研究有浓厚兴趣，有志于从事学术研究的普通高校全日制</span><strong><span>2027年应届本科毕业生</span></strong><span>，预计可获得所在学校推荐免试资格的同学优先。</span></p><p><span>（3）所学专业为生物学、医学、药学、生物信息学、计算机等相关专业，成绩优异、在校期间无重修或补考科目。</span></p><p><span>（4）英语能力良好，达到大学英语四、六级以及相当水平，</span><strong><span>CET4≥450分或CET6≥430分。</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY5EKdMAry1MZiahMLKAOf0icjKVJedj8Wzxa7h1tbWn2HWwogDxmB9pvLupvcicJIznRbg8ZJEFpDM3myicP3xgbZibyNME0iapBku54/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>（1）附照片的个人简历（除基本信息外，请侧重描述与意向专业相关的技能、科研项目、比赛经历以及获奖情况等）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）本科在读期间成绩单（截至目前）、专业排名证明，均须由教务部门盖章。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）英语四级、六级成绩单或其他英语考试的成绩证明。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）专家推荐信2封，需副教授及以上职称专家分别推荐（自愿提供）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）其他证明材料（如体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文或其他原创性工作成果、获奖证书等）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（6）身份证正反面，学生证信息页、注册页（可打水印）。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section></section><section><p><strong><span>材料提交和入群通知</span></strong></p></section><section></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span><span>（1）请将申请材料（1-2项）合并成1个PDF，文件命名为：学校-专业-姓名-简历及成绩单。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）请将申请材料（3-6项）合并成1个PDF，文件命名为：学校-专业-姓名-夏令营证明材料，文件大小控制在8M以内。</span></span></p><p><span><span>      请将按要求命名的以上2个PDF文件邮件发送至ismzhaosheng@126.com，邮件主题为“学校-专业-姓名-2026年系统所夏令营申请”。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）请扫描二维码填写在线表格《2026年苏州系统医学研究所夏令营报名表》（务必填写并提交）。所有申请材料须如实填写和提供，如有不实申报将取消其资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）报名同学请及时扫码加入2026年协和系统所夏令营QQ群，以便接收最新通知，群中昵称请修改为：学校＋姓名。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY5EMTatSCLAB1aatXvt7edMjA0k4pE51HTLcFX4QyOKGx0G5wmN3ezQjYUG3icZbgt5sLpB3M3iafCF7L6icQO0YMJajibecNazYAA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY70Q4IHyn79EL2bKS0XFxfx6ib9iasPlicHpysPIG9UktV6haYg5t10DVsOtMHMxHvGhSEUISYxibdaB0Ow7MedXSMLHmydpEicMrq8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><span>【扫码填写】</span></p><p><span>系统所夏令营报名表</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>【扫码进群】</span></p><p><span>系统所夏令营QQ群</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY6zAwf50suuUoYicaga5lc6FwDvMCxHCauYnj0Fv1B6auuBerbibCKGXKKrFIicjFPqickKg6Ds4K2l1ibs7OWwiauplYwAMmuKbJ5wM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>审核与入营</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>      审核工作由系统所组成专家小组负责。2026年7月17日前入营名单及后期安排会以电子邮件形式通知本人，届时未接到邮件通知的同学为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ynWPy1lRVY6CGPBkPJRznPQ4jdiaybAib8Ygef3q7M95J9Dxiakb11qrgKeSREhDq3LDBmicNjCU3prI96ShywJnAAvf1hibby82DmP9X8edrlHY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>联系人：</span></strong><span>张老师、黄老师</span></p><p><strong><span>电   话：</span></strong><span>0512-62875116</span></p><p><strong><span>邮   箱：</span></strong><span>ismzhaosheng@126.com</sp